{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Stellara Vanguard</strong></i>, you take on the role of a warrior tasked with defending crucial planets of the Stellara Kingdom. During each match, you\u2019ll face relentless enemies, enhance your abilities, and build powerful defenses to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress During the Round</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to defend the vital planets of the Stellara Kingdom. To do so, you must eliminate endless hordes of enemies. During each round, you can obtain cards that grant strategic upgrades, such as freezing shots or even missile attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To aid you in your mission, purchase, place, and upgrade various combat towers. There is a wide variety of towers at your disposal\u2014use them strategically to best match your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 types of cards available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 towers available with their upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each match, the game evolves: new combinations of upgrades, tower placements, and more aggressive enemies keep the combat intense and unpredictable. Only the most skilled will be able to defend Stellara to the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078760?t=1760464836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078760?t=1760464836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/181f45f2ef9325b9c3c11de32354016bfca5b27b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760464836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/181f45f2ef9325b9c3c11de32354016bfca5b27b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760464836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/d567a5a83886d42720e975aad0cf51e0.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i><strong>Stellara Vanguard</strong></i>, you take on the role of a warrior tasked with defending crucial planets of the Stellara Kingdom. During each match, you\u2019ll face relentless enemies, enhance your abilities, and build powerful defenses to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/bf83d57db1ebf1953aabaedaa1860a0a.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Elements</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress During the Round</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to defend the vital planets of the Stellara Kingdom. To do so, you must eliminate endless hordes of enemies. During each round, you can obtain cards that grant strategic upgrades, such as freezing shots or even missile attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/89b878a1b98859c5552ce9d1b7909674.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To aid you in your mission, purchase, place, and upgrade various combat towers. There is a wide variety of towers at your disposal\u2014use them strategically to best match your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.poster.avif?t=1760464836\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.webm?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/extras/49415d28ef8178e6de2a52683a0baba8.mp4?t=1760464836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 types of cards available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 towers available with their upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each match, the game evolves: new combinations of upgrades, tower placements, and more aggressive enemies keep the combat intense and unpredictable. Only the most skilled will be able to defend Stellara to the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pretoriano_dev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3976560","name":"Stellara Vanguard"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078760/ed05db9ab5e94a1cc2f8f74eecc1bbb6d498a6e8/header.jpg?t=1760464836","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078760/1407752428/53194f72115a602a69b4e18e5d2f72d2f1316987/1760363583/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760364247","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078760/1407752428/53194f72115a602a69b4e18e5d2f72d2f1316987/1760